# kwkit personal matplotlib overlay.
#
# Stacked LAST by kwkit.viz.style(), on top of SciencePlots ("science" +
# "no-latex"), so anything set here wins. Intentionally empty for now: fill it
# at use, one line at a time, as recurring annoyances show up. No Python needed,
# just "key: value" entries (see the matplotlib rcParams reference).
#
# Examples to uncomment / adapt when you know what bothers you:
#
# figure.figsize: 4.0, 3.0
# figure.dpi: 150
# savefig.dpi: 300
# font.family: sans-serif
# font.size: 10
# axes.grid: True
# grid.alpha: 0.3
# legend.frameon: False
